# S26 Ultra — MEC device plane

Target package namespace for Ava007 Dialer: `com.s26ultra.a2a`

## Qualcomm GenieX Chat Android (on-device LLM/VLM)

Upstream sample for Snapdragon NPU/GPU/CPU chat on Android:

- **Source:** https://github.com/qualcomm/ai-hub-apps/blob/release/geniex_chat_android/info.yaml
- **App id:** `geniex_chat_android`
- **Headline:** Run LLMs and VLMs on Android with GenieX
- **Runtime:** `geniex_qairt`, `geniex_llamacpp`
- **License:** BSD-3-Clause (nexa-sdk)
- **OS:** Android 12+
- **Languages:** Kotlin, Java
- **Models download at runtime** via GenieX SDK (`disable_cli_model_fetch: true`)

### Supported devices (upstream)

| Device | Status |
|--------|--------|
| Samsung Galaxy S25 | Tested |
| Samsung Galaxy S26 | Not Tested |

S26 / S26 Ultra is the intended validation target for Ava007 on-device intelligence
alongside the Dialer (`apps/Ava007-Dialer`). GenieX is a **reference integration**,
not a weight merge into the Dialer APK.

