### Policy

- Dialer source stays under `apps/Ava007-Dialer` (Gradle 8.11.1).
- pnpm applies only if/when a JS workspace package is added; it does **not** build the APK.
- APK builds use a container with JDK 17 + Android SDK 36 + Gradle — no GitHub Actions requirement, no Termux project layout.
- See `docs/MEC-WORKSPACE.md` and `docs/container-apk-build.md`.
